PACKAGE NAME:     mitsumi
PACKAGE SIZE:     393 K
PACKAGE LOCATION: diskq2
PACKAGE DESCRIPTION:
mitsumi:  Linux kernel version 1.1.18, with SCSI+IDE+ Unifix Mitsumi CD driver. 
mitsumi:
mitsumi:  This kernel is just like the standard Mitsumi kernel, but uses the
mitsumi:  version of the Mitsumi driver that was enhanced by Unifix. I tested
mitsumi:  it on my machine (with a Mitsumi FXD-001), and it improved the speed
mitsumi:  from 41K/s to 226K/s! 
mitsumi:
mitsumi:  This kernel also has support for PPP, UMSDOS, CSLIP, Ethernet,
mitsumi:  Ftape, and the PS/2 style mouse (but not other busmouse types).
mitsumi:
